WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:20.449
Oh, hi! Who are you?

2
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:24.736
I'm an Eastern box turtle.

3
00:00:24.737 --> 00:00:28.541
Turtles are reptiles.

4
00:00:28.542 --> 00:00:31.100
Where do you live?

5
00:00:31.101 --> 00:00:36.829
Eastern box turtles live in the United States.

6
00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:42.991
We like forests, meadows, and marshes.

7
00:00:42.992 --> 00:00:46.133
Do you like the water?

8
00:00:46.134 --> 00:00:51.218
We usually live near ponds and streams.

9
00:00:51.219 --> 00:00:55.454
We go in the water to cool off.

10
00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:58.512
I like your shell.

11
00:00:58.513 --> 00:01:02.757
Our shells are very hard.

12
00:01:02.758 --> 00:01:07.082
We can hide inside them.

13
00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:11.912
That protects us from enemies.

14
00:01:11.913 --> 00:01:14.681
What do you eat?

15
00:01:14.682 --> 00:01:20.304
Older Eastern box turtles mostly eat plants.

16
00:01:20.305 --> 00:01:27.443
But younger ones like fish, snails, and bugs.

17
00:01:27.444 --> 00:01:30.305
How long do you live?

18
00:01:30.306 --> 00:01:35.089
We can live for a long time.

19
00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:40.938
Some of us live over a hundred years!

20
00:01:40.939 --> 00:01:44.006
Do you lay eggs?

21
00:01:44.007 --> 00:01:49.936
Yes, we dig holes with our back legs.

22
00:01:49.937 --> 00:01:54.959
Then we lay eggs in the hole.

23
00:01:54.960 --> 00:02:02.276
Babies crawl out three months later.

24
00:02:02.277 --> 00:02:05.030
I see a fox!

25
00:02:05.031 --> 00:02:09.850
I'm going to hide in my shell.

26
00:02:09.851 --> 00:02:17.214
Good-bye, Eastern Box Turtle!
